hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"911","Hajjaj aur Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Hammad bin Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Asim se, Zirr se, Abdullah bin Masud se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se unhon ne farmaya: Hajj ke ayyam mein mausam mein mujh par ummaten pesh ki gayin, to mujhe meri ummat ki kasrat bhali lagi, woh sahl aur pahad ko bhar chuke the, kaha gaya: Ai Muhammad, kya tum raazi ho, unhon ne farmaya: Haan ai mere Rab, Unhon ne farmaya: Pas in ke sath sattar hazar hain jo baghair hisab ke Jannat mein dakhil honge, aur woh woh hain jo na dam karwate hain aur na dagh lagwate hain aur na badshaguni lete hain, aur apne Rab par tawakkul karte hain, Ukkasha ne kaha: Pas Allah se dua kijiye ke woh mujhe un mein se bana de, Unhon ne farmaya: Ai Allah ise un mein se bana de, to ek aur aadmi ne kaha: Allah se dua kijiye ke woh mujhe un mein se bana de, Unhon ne farmaya: Ukkasha is mein tum se sabqat le gaya."
"912","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi al-Zinad ne mujh se bayan kiya, Alqama se, un ki walida se, Aisha se, ke un ke pas bachche laye jate the jab woh paida hote to woh un ke liye barkat ki dua kartin, to un ke pas ek bachcha laya gaya, to woh us ka takiya rakhne lagin, to achanak us ke sar ke niche ek chhuri thi, to unhon ne un se chhuri ke bare mein pucha, to unhon ne kaha: Hum ise jinnon se hifazat ke liye rakhte hain, to unhon ne chhuri li aur use phenk diya, aur unhen is se mana kiya aur kaha: Beshak Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam badshaguni ko napasand karte the aur is se bughz rakhte the, aur Aisha is se mana karti thin."
"913","Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qatada ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se: Na chhoot hai, aur na badshaguni hai, aur mujhe nek faal achha lagta hai, achhi baat."
"914","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Amir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Abi Kathir se unhon ne kaha: Hayya al-Tamimi ne mujh se bayan kiya, ke un ke walid ne unhen khabar di, ke unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Haam mein kuch nahi, aur badshaguni mein sab se sachcha faal hai, aur nazar lagna haq hai."
"915","Ibrahim bin al-Munzir ne hum se bayan kiya, Maan bin Isa se unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Muammal ne mujh se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abdullah bin al-Saib se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam Hudaibiya ke saal, jab Usman bin Affan ne zikr kiya ke Suhail ko us ki qaum ne un ki taraf bhej kar bheja hai, to unhon ne us se is par sulah ki ke woh is saal un se wapas laut jaye, aur woh use un ke liye ainda teen tak khali kar den, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne jab woh aaya jab kaha gaya: Suhail aaya hai, farmaya: Allah tumhara muamla aasan farmaye, aur Abdullah bin al-Saib ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka zamana paya tha."
"916","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, Hamza aur Salim ibna Abdullah bin Umar se, Abdullah bin Umar se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Nahoosat ghar mein, aur aurat mein, aur ghode mein hai."
"917","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Hazim bin Dinar se, Sahl bin Saad se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Agar nahoosat kisi cheez mein ho to aurat mein, aur ghode mein, aur maskan mein hai."
"918","Ubaidullah bin Said yani Abu Qudama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr bin Umar al-Zahrani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ikrima bin Ammar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ishaq bin Abdullah se, Anas bin Malik se unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasool, hum ek ghar mein the jis mein hamari tadad zyada hui, aur is mein hamare maal zyada hue, phir hum dusre ghar ki taraf muntaqil hue, to is mein hamari tadad kam ho gayi, aur is mein hamare maal kam ho gaye, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Use wapas kar do, ya use chhod do, aur woh mazmoom hai."
"919","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Said al-Maqburi ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se unhon ne farmaya: Beshak Allah chheenk ko pasand farmata hai, aur jamahi ko napasand farmata hai, pas jab woh chheenke aur Allah ki hamd kare to har Musalman par jo use sune haq hai ke woh use yarhamukallah kahe, aur rahi jamahi to woh shaitan ki taraf se hai, pas use jahan tak ho sake roke, phir jab woh haah kahe to shaitan us par hansta hai."
"920","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Awana se, Ata se, Said bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se unhon ne kaha: Jab tum mein se koi chheenke aur kahe: Alhamdulillah, to farishta kehta hai: Rabb al-alamin, phir jab woh kahe: Rabb al-alamin, to farishta kehta hai: Yarhamukallah."
"921","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz bin Abi Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Salih al-Samman se, Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se unhon ne farmaya: Jab woh chheenke to kahe: Alhamdulillah, phir jab woh kahe to us ka bhai ya us ka sathi use kahe: Yarhamukallah, phir jab woh use kahe: Yarhamukallah to woh kahe: Yahdikumullah wa yuslihu balakum. Abu Abdullah ne kaha: Is bab mein jo sab se sabit riwayat bayan ki jati hai woh ye hadith hai jo Abu Salih al-Samman se riwayat ki jati hai."
"922","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fazari ne humen khabar di, Abdur Rahman bin Ziyad bin Anum al-Ifriqi se unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, ke woh Muawiya ke zamane mein samandar mein ghazi the, to hamari kashti Abu Ayyub al-Ansari ki kashti se mil gayi, to jab hamara dopahar ka khana hazir hua hum ne un ki taraf bheja, to woh hamare pas aaye aur farmaya: Tum ne mujhe bulaya aur main rozedar tha, to mere liye tumhen jawab dene ke siwa chara na tha, kyunke main ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Beshak Musalman ke liye us ke bhai par chhe khaslaten wajib hain, agar woh un mein se kuch chhod de to us ne apne bhai ka us par wajib haq chhod diya: Jab woh use mile use salam kare, aur jab woh use bulaye use jawab de, aur jab woh chheenke use yarhamukallah kahe, aur jab woh bimar ho us ki iyadat kare, aur jab woh mar jaye us ke janaze mein hazir ho, aur jab woh mashwara mange use naseehat kare. Unhon ne kaha: Aur hamare sath ek mazah karne wala aadmi tha jo ek aadmi se jis ne hamara khana paya kehta: Jazakallahu khairan wa birran, to jab us ne us par zyadati ki to woh us par ghazabnak hua, to us ne Abu Ayyub se kaha: Ek aadmi ke bare mein aap kya dekhte hain jab main use kehta hun: Jazakallahu khairan wa birran, to woh ghazabnak hota hai aur mujhe bura kehta hai, to Abu Ayyub ne kaha: Hum kehte the: Beshak jise bhalai sanware use bhalai sanwarti hai aur jise bhalai na sanware use burai sanwarti hai, pas us par ulta kar do, to jab woh us ke pas aaya to us se kaha: Jazakallahu sharran wa arran, to woh hansa aur raazi ho gaya aur kaha: Tum apna mazah nahi chhodte, to us aadmi ne kaha: Allah Abu Ayyub al-Ansari ko khair de."
